==History==
2016
*The Graveyard [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 28/10/2016.
*On 1/11/2016, the [[Version History#November%202016%20Update%20(1/11/2016)|November 2016 Update]], changed the Graveyard's description. Prior to this, its description was "''Unearths a gang of Skeletons anywhere in the Arena. Spooky!''"
2017
*On 11/8/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (11/8/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the Graveyard's duration to 9 seconds (from 10 seconds).
*On 9/10/2017, the [[Version History#Epic Quests Update (9/10/2017)|Epic Quests Update]], increased the Graveyard's duration to 10 seconds (from 9 seconds), decreased its radius to 4 tiles (from 5), increased the first spawn time interval to 2 seconds (from 1.5 seconds), and made the spawn mechanics of the [[Skeletons]] less random by making the Skeletons spawn on the edge.
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], allowed the Graveyard to be placed on the river.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards start at Level 9 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 5).
2019
*On 28/1/2019, the [[Version History#January%202019%20Update%20(28/1/2019)|January 2019 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Graveyard from Spell Valley to Spooky Town.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], removed the Graveyard from [[Touchdown]] [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Draft]].
2020
*On 3/11/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/11/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the minimum range where Skeletons can potentially spawn to 3.5 tiles (from 3 tiles).
*On 18/11/2020, the [[Version History#Clan Wars Improvement Update (18/11/2020)|Clan Wars Improvement Update]], reverted the Graveyard to its state before 3/11/2020. More specifically, the minimum range where Skeletons can potentially spawn was decreased to 3 tiles (from 3.5 tiles).
*On 9/12/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/12/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the first spawn time interval to 2.2 seconds (from 2 seconds).
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022 
*On 4/4/2022, the [[Version History#April%202022%20Update%20(4/4/2022)|April 2022 Update]], decreased the Graveyard's duration to 9.5 seconds (from 10 seconds)
*On 3/6/2022, a maintenance break, added a card render to the Graveyard's card info screen.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], added the Siege Weapon [[Card Mastery]] task for the Graveyard.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 5/3/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Graveyard’s duration to 9 seconds (from 9.5 seconds).
2025
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] made it so that the [[Witch/Evolution|Evolved Witch]] would no longer be healed by defeated Skeletons.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] increased the Skeleton's attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.0 seconds).
2026

* On 12/1/2026, a Balance Update changed the graveyard's spawn pattern from random to defined, and increased the amount of skeletons to 14 (from 13).
* On 14/1/2026, a Maintenance Break, decreased the amount of skeletons to 13 (from 14), and made it to where the skeletons spawn closer to the edge of the graveyard
* On 2/2/2026, a Balance Update, increased the spawn radius to 3.3 tiles (from 2.9 tiles)
* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the amount of skeletons to 12 (from 13)

