==Trivia==
*In Clash of Clans, there is a similar spell called the [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Skeleton_Spell Skeleton Spell], which summons Skeletons within its radius. It originally summoned its Skeletons all at once, but has since been reworked to behave similarly to the Graveyard. However, unlike the Graveyard, the Skeleton Spell in Clash of Clans spawns Skeletons with shields, similar to [[Guards]].
*The Graveyard is 1 of 15 [[cards]] associated with [[Skeletons]], with the others being [[Bomber]], [[Skeleton Dragons]], [[Skeleton Barrel]], [[Tombstone]], [[Bomb Tower]], [[Skeleton Army]], Guards, [[Witch]], [[Balloon]], [[Giant Skeleton]], [[Wall Breakers]], [[Super Witch]], [[Skeleton King]], and of course, Skeletons.
**In the Norwegian, Arabic, Indonesian, and Vietnamese language settings of the game, the Graveyard's name translates to "Cemetery". In the Japanese, Korean, and Chinese language settings of the game, the Graveyard's name translates to "Skeleton Rush", "Tomb", and "Skeleton Call" respectively.
**A Trainer in the [[Training Camp]] is called Trainer Gravy, and uses the Graveyard in the [[Battle Decks|deck]]. This is a reference to the fact that the word "graveyard" can be abbreviated to "gravy".
**It is the only [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]] card associated with Skeletons.
*The Graveyard is 1 of 7 spells which have team-colored rings on their radius, the others are [[Earthquake]], [[Freeze]], [[Poison]], [[Rage]], [[Clone]], and [[Tornado]].
*The small tombstones visual effect can be seen in this card's image and also when this card is deployed. This effect is taken from Clash of Clans when Elixir troops die.
*The jingle that plays upon its deployment is an excerpt from the [https://youtu.be/74oFkMQ-KaM?t=8 Clash of Clans battle theme].
*The Graveyard was featured in the winning decks of multiple Clash Royale Tournaments. More specifically:
**The Graveyard was featured in the winning deck of the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kIGdeKaT_is The Crown Duel Tournament], by a player called Backstabx.
**The Graveyard was featured in the winning deck of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/cmBlEI-aDoo?si=UoD1Sit2YvQR19xs Clash Royale League 2019 Tournament], by a player called Surgical Goblin.
